3 TEXT He died without heirs of his body on 15 Sept. last [1408]. His next heirs are Edmund son of Eleanor his sister, aged 18 years and more, Joan duchess of York, wife of William de Wyloughby, his second sister, 24 and more, Margaret w
4 CONC idow of John earl of Somerset, his third sister, 22 and more, Eleanor wife of the earl of Salisbury, his fourth sister, 21 and more, and Elizabeth wife of John de Nevyll, his fifth sister, 20 and more.
