2 CONT '''Marie de Luxembourg, Comtesse de St. Pol'''1 
2 CONT F, #113712, '''d. 1 April 1546'''
2 CONT Last Edited=14 Apr 2007
2 CONT Consanguinity Index=0.09%
2 CONT '''     Marie de Luxembourg, Comtesse de St. Pol was the daughter''' of Pierre II de Luxembourg, Comte de St. Pol and Margaret di Savoia.1 '''She married François de Bourbon, Duc de Vendôme''', son of Jean II de Bourbon, Comte de 
2 CONC Vendôme and Isabel de Beauveau, '''on 8 September 1487. She died on 1 April 1546.'''
2 CONT '''    She gained the title of Comtesse de St. Pol.'''
2 CONT '''Children of Marie de Luxembourg, Comtesse de St. Pol and François de Bourbon, Duc de Vendôme'''
2 CONT *Charles IV de Bourbon, Duc de Vendôme+1 b. 2 Jun 1489, d. 25 Mar 1537
2 CONT *François de Bourbon, Duc d'Estouteville+1 b. 1491, d. 1545
