2 CONT # Charles V
2 CONT ===Children===
2 CONT # Charles VI
2 CONT # Louis, Duke of Orléans
2 CONT # Charles VI
2 CONT =====Children=====
2 CONT # Isabella of Valois
2 CONT # Michelle of Valois
2 CONT # Catherine of Valois
2 CONT # Charles VII
2 CONT # Charles VII
