2 CONT '''     Jean de Viennois, Dauphin de France was born in 1398.1 He married Jacqueline von Bayern-Straubing, Comtesse de Hainaut et Gravin van Holland en Zeeland''', daughter of Wilhelm IV Herzog von Bayern-Straubing Comte de Hainau
2 CONC t et Graaf van Holland en Zeeland and Marguerite de Bourgogne, '''in July 1406.1 He died in 1417.'''1
2 CONT '''     He gained the title of Dauphin de France.'''1
