1 NOTE Peter I of Bourbon (1311 – September 19, 1356, Poitiers) was the second Duke of Bourbon, from 1342 to his death. Peter was son of Louis I of Bourbon, whom he also succeeded as Grand Chamberlain of France, and Mary of Hainaut.
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Isabella of Valois, daughter of Charles, Count of Valois and Mahaut of Chatillon. Peter and Isabella had only one son, Louis, and six daughters. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Peter died in the Battle of Poitiers.
