2 CONT 14 Generation Pedigree of Friedrich Wilhelm III, King of Prussia (#2)
2 CONT '''     Isabel Beauvieu was born circa 1436.2 She married Jean II de Bourbon, Comte de Vendome''', son of Louis de Bourbon, Comte de Vendome & Chartres and Johanna Laval, '''on 9 November 1454 at Angers, Marne-et-Loire, Pays de la
2 CONC  Loire, France.2 Isabel Beauvieu died in 1474'''.2
2 CONT '''Family'''
