2 CONT '''Blanche of Montferrat''' (Italian: Bianca di Monferrato; 1472 – 30 March 1519) was the duchess of Savoy as the wife of Charles I of Savoy.[1] She acted as regent for her only son Charles from 1490 until his accidental death in 
2 CONC 1496.
2 CONT
2 CONT # [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Blanche_of_Montferrat#Marriage Marriage]
