2 CONC 1384|p10522.htm#i105214|Marie de Châtillon|b. c 1343\nd. 12 Nov 1404|p11364.htm#i113635|Juan I., Rey de Aragón|b. 27 Dec 1350\nd. 13 May 1395|p11340.htm#i113399|Mathe d'Armagnac|d. 1380|p11340.htm#i113400|
2 CONT
