2 CONT   Adam Gordon married Elizabeth de Moravia, Countess of Sutherland, daughter of John de Moravia, 8th Earl of Sutherland and Margaret Macdonald, circa 1500.1 He died between 17 March 1537 and 1538.
2 CONT      He was the son of George Gordon, 2nd Earl of Huntly and Lady Elizabeth Hay.1,2     He gained the title of Lord of Aboyne [feudal barony].1 Children of Adam Gordon and Elizabeth de Moravia, Countess of Sutherland
