2 _MARNM Stewart
1 NAME Dauphine of /France/
1 NAME Of Scotland /Margaret/
1 NAME Margaret of Scotland, Dauphine de France
1 SEX F
1 BIRT
2 DATE ABT 1424
1 DEAT
2 DATE 16 AUG 1445
2 PLAC Châlons, Marne, Champagne-Ardenne, France
