2 CONT Henriette Catherine de Joyeuse , duchess of Joyeuse , Joinville princess (1585-1656).
2 CONT
2 CONT Born in the Louvre January 13 1585. She was the daughter of Henri de Joyeuse , Count du Bouchage , and Catherine Nogaret of Valetta niece of the Duke of Epernon and Duke Duke of Joyeuse, favorite of King Henry III . She was Duches
