2 CONT '''Antoinette de Bourbon was born on 25 December 1493. She was the daughter of''' François de Bourbon, Duc de Vendôme and Marie de Luxembourg, Comtesse de St. Pol.2 '''She married Claude de Lorraine, Duc de Guise''', son of René I
2 CONC I de Vaudémont, Duc de Lorraine and Philippa van Egmond-Gelre, '''in 1513. She died on 22 January 1583 at age 89.'''
