2 CONT
2 CONT 8 January 1499 – 9 January 1514
2 CONT
2 CONT Coronation 	8 February 1492
2 CONT
2 CONT Spouse 	Maximilian I, Holy Roman Emperor
2 CONT
2 CONT Charles VIII of France
2 CONT
