2 CONT -http://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/VENICE.htm#_Toc295408199<br/>
2 CONT 3.        'MICHELE Sbarra Morosini .  Patrician of Venice.  '''m''' ---.  The name of Michele´s wife is not known.  Michele & his wife had four children:  
2 CONT
2 CONT *a)         CONSTANZA Morosini .  ...'''m'''  ([24 Aug 1293]) as his first wife, VLADISLAV of Serbia, son of STEFAN DRAGUTIN King of Serbia & his wife Katalin of Hungary (-in Hungary after 1326).  
2 CONT *b)         [https://www.geni.com/people/Tomasina-Morosini-queen-mother-of-Hungary-Duchess-of-Slavonia/6000000002188307733 TOMASINA Morosini] (-end 1300). ... '''m''' ([1265/70]) as his second wife, ISTVÁN of Hungary Duke of Slavo
2 CONC nia, son of ANDRÁS II King of Hungary & his third wife Beatrice d'Este (posthumously 1236-1271 shortly after 10 Apr). 
2 CONT *c)         ALBERTO Morosini (-after 1290).  The marriage contract between "Dominum Albertum comitem Goricie…filiam suam dominam Claram" and "domino Andrea…duce Sclavonie nepote olim…domini Andree regis Hungarie" is dated 6 Jun 12
2 CONC 86, and names "dominum Albertinum Mauroceno de Venecia…avunculus eiusdem domini ducis"[236].  The continuator of Andrea Dandulo´s Chronicon Venetum records that "juvenis Andreaxius de regno Hungarico" appointed "Albertinum Mauroce
2 CONC no avunculum eius" as "Banum et Ducem Sclavoniæ" after his coronation in 1290[237].  
2 CONT *d)         --- Morosini.  '''m''' ---.  One child:  
2 CONT **i)          '''TOMASINA Morosini''' . ...  '''m''' PIETRO Gradenigo Doge of Venice, son of --- (-1311). 
2 CONT
2 CONT ------
2 CONT
2 CONT Si unì in matrimonio - non se ne conosce l'anno - con '''Tommasina Morosini''', figlia di Giovanni e nipote di [https://www.geni.com/people/Tomasina-Morosini-queen-mother-of-Hungary-Duchess-of-Slavonia/6000000002188307733 Tommasin
2 CONC a], moglie del principe Stefano d'Ungheria e madre del re Andrea III, il Veneziano, che gli diede numerosi figli e che sicuramente gli premorì. Tra i maschi i genealogisti ricordano 
2 CONT *Bertucci, 
