2 CONT     Giacomo qu Pagano is condottiero serving the Signoria in Pisa , see Sanudo I. 991
2 CONT
2 CONT     Savorgnan x San Anzolo da Crema , she is daughter of domino Matteo
2 CONT     She returned to Venice on 22.12.1498 with her brother-in-law Girolamo Savorgnan and her brother Angelo Francesco da San Angelo
2 CONT
2 CONT     He + 16.11.1498 as condottiero in Venetian service , he is ' zentilhomo nostro et morto a nostra servicio '
2 CONT
2 CONT anno 03.12.1484 : Girolamo qu Pagano ( sponsors are Tristano Savorgnan qu Pagano & Francesco Savorgnan doctor di Nicolo , tt. are Nicolo Priuli qu Domenico & Pietro Michiel di Luca )
2 CONT    Girolamo qu Pagano is elected in zonta Senate on 01.10.1509
2 CONT    He is elected in zonta Senate on 30.09.1511 with a very good score of 577 di si & only 59 di no , his loyalty was rewarded
2 CONT    He is pledge for Arimondo - bank on 17.03.1524
2 CONT
