1 NOTE "OF MONMOUTH"; CREATED 4TH PRINCE OF WALES 1399; ACCEDED 3/21/1413 (CROWNED
2 CONT WESTMINSTER); RULED FROM 1413-1422; VICTOR AT AGINCOURT; BEARER OF THE SWAN
