2 CONT '''Madeleine de la Tour'''1,2
2 CONT Last Edited	9 May 2002
2 CONT F, #81800, '''b. circa 1498, d. 28 April 1519'''
2 CONT '''Father'''	Jean I, Sire de la Tour, Comte d'Auvergne, Lauraguais, & Boulogne2,1 b. 1467, d. 28 Mar 1501
2 CONT '''Mother'''	Jeanne 'the Beautiful' de Bourbon1,2 b. c 1465, d. 22 Jan 1512
2 CONT '''     Madeleine de la Tour was born circa 1498. A contract for the marriage of Madeleine de la Tour and Lorenzo II de Medici, Duke d'Urbino was signed on 16 January 1518.1,2 Madeleine de la Tour died on 28 April 1519'''.1,2
