2 CONT
2 CONT Vendramin x Corner anno 1473 ( Paolo fu Andrea Duca di Venezia  x Cornelia di Marco cavalier qu Giorgio )         Carta 202                                                    
2 CONT
2 CONT Decima 1514 . San Eufemia . 56 , no sum is mentioned , probably 40 ducats
2 CONT Decima 1521 . San Eufemia , 67 , 91 ducats
2 CONT
2 CONT anno 1497 : Andrea ( sponsor is the mother - widow , tt. are Paolo Capello eques qu Vettore & Daniele Vendramin qu Nicolo )                
2 CONT     1) Andrea is avogador piccoli on 08.07.1497 .   This act is repeated on 09.08.1498
2 CONT          Andrea & Nicolo & Marco together in a lawsuit against their natural brother Marino , see Sanudo X. 809 on 18.07.1510
2 CONT          Andrea went to Rome to become a priest on 10.12.1511
2 CONT          He hopes to obtain the comandaria di San Giovanni di Treviso on 19.11.1517
2 CONT
2 CONT          Decima 1514 . San Eufemia .70 anno 1521 by his son Marco . estimo of 119 ducats
2 CONT
2 CONT anno 1503 : Marco qu Paolo qu il Princeps ( sponsor is the mother - widow , tt. are Domenico Contarini qu Maffeo & Carolo Priuli di Costantino )           
2 CONT     2) Marco is capitano Vicenza on 07.05.1517 , he was at Balla d'Oro on 01.12.1503
2 CONT          He was elected as capitano Vicenza on 22.11.1515 pro ducati 1000
2 CONT          Marco qu Paolo qu il Serenissimo nominated Marin Sanudo at election for censor on 12.09.1518
2 CONT          He is at guard of honor at lying in state of deceased Doge on 22.06.1521
2 CONT          He is on XXX on 28.06.1521 at election of Antonio Grimani
2 CONT          He is elected podesta Chioggia on 12.11.1525
2 CONT          His commissaria is at dazio di biave on 06.08.1529 with 300 ducats
2 CONT
2 CONT          Decima 1514 . San Eufemia. 40 . Estimo of 201 ducats
2 CONT
2 CONT        Marco qu Paolo qu il Serenissimo + as podesta Chioggia on 21.04.1527 , in his place is elected Domenico Lion qu Alvise who immediately takes up the function
2 CONT
2 CONT        Vendramin x Grimani anno 1512 ( Marco fu Paolo x Lucia di Girolamo ) , see Sanudo XIV . 299
2 CONT
2 CONT no probation : Nicolo
2 CONT    3)  Nicolo qu Paolo is member of the compagnia named ' Fausti ' , see Sanudo IV. on 19.02.1502
2 CONT         He is at election on 28.03.1509 for post of pagador in campo , he got a good score in election
2 CONT         He is sent to Padua as sopracomito on 31.08.1509 with men from the Zuecca
2 CONT         Nicolo is elected sopracomito by the X on 11.04.1510 after loan of 1500 ducats
2 CONT         He is banished for 10 years to¨Padua on 13.02.1510 , punishment for helping to escape from prison Alvise Soranzo qu Vettore
2 CONT         He obtained a gratia on 26.06.1511
2 CONT         He is elected proveditor & executor in campo on 30.05.1513 , Sanudo is much impressed by this young nominee , see Sanudo XVI pagina 314
2 CONT         He is elected proveditor sopra il flisco on 09.05.1515 , see Sanudo XX pagina 196
2 CONT         Nicolo is elected podesta & capitano Treviso on 23.09.1515 , see also Sanudo XXI pagina 188     
2 CONT         He returned to Venice ,  in the Collegio on 30.06.1517     
2 CONT         He is senator on 28.08.1517  
2 CONT         He is senator on 08.08.1518                                        
2 CONT
2 CONT          Decima 1514 . San Eufemia . 68 anno 1521 commissaria , estimo of 131 ducats
2 CONT
2 CONT          Vendramin x Diedo ( Nicolo qu Paolo qu il Serenissimo x filia qu Antonio ) , marriage on 04.07.1514 , the dota is 8000 ducats
2 CONT
2 CONT          Nicolo + 27.10.1518 aged 35 , era di Pregadi , fo podesta Treviso *
2 CONT
2 CONT          Sanudo says ' he will be missed by the whole terra , he would have become one of the Primi of the city  '
2 CONT
2 CONT          He left 1 daughter aged 14 years
2 CONT
2 CONT Also : Morosini x Vendramin anno 1508 ( Leonardo di Gabriele x Regina di Paolo qu il Serenissimo )
2 CONT Also : Priuli x Vendramin anno 1498 ( Carolo qu Costantino qu Giovanni Procurator x Angela di Paolo qu el Serenissimo  )
