2 CONC avent”, the manuscript noting that his mother was “[https://www.geni.com/people/Yve-de-Lieu/6000000015089190811?through=6000000002187845469 Ive sLuis] van de gheslachte van de Lus, van Ghendt”[828]. m (1419) as her second marriage
