2 CONT #  "Chapter 5", The promised lands: the Low countries under Burgundian rule, p. 112, Retrieved 6 oct 2009.
2 CONT # "John the Fearless", p. 236, Retrieved 6 oct 2009.
2 CONT # "The Burgundian Netherlands", 1986, W. Prevenier, p. 242, 244
2 CONT # "The Recognition of Pope Eugenius IV in the Empire", Pope Eugenius IV, the Council of Basel..., p. 277, Retrieved 6 oct 2009.
2 CONT # "Joan of Arc", p. 56, Retrieved 6 oct 2009.
2 CONT #  "The Maid of Orleans", The History of France, Volume 2, p. 147, Retrieved 6 oct 2009.
