1 OCCU Herzogin zu Kleve und Gräfin zu der Mark, Duchess of Cleves; Countess of Mark, Marie of Burgundy, Duchess of Cleves
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Links:==
2 CONT *[http://www.geneall.net/F/per_page.php?id=1446 Geneall]
2 CONT *[http://gw1.geneanet.org/hwember1?lang=de;pz=maximilian;nz=von+bayern;ocz=10;p=maria;n=von+burgund+capet;oc=1 Geneanet in german]
