2 CONT '''     Mary (Claudia) of Burgundy was born after 1393.2 She married Adolph I, Duke of Cleeves''', son of Adolph VI, Earl of Cologne, Count Kleve & Marck and Margaret von Ravensberg, '''on 12 July 1406. Mary (Claudia) of Burgundy 
2 CONC died on 30 October 1463 at Monreberg near Kalkar; Buried at Grawe, near Wesel.'''2
2 CONT '''Family'''
2 CONT '''Adolph I, Duke of Cleeves''' b. 2 Aug 1373, d. 23 Sep 1448
2 CONT '''Children	'''
