2 CONT Nobility. Born sometime between 1379 and 1384 as the daughter of Juan I "el Cazador" King of Aragon and his second wife Yolande de Bar. Her son-in-law, the later Charles VII, was raised at her court. When he became king, she was t
2 CONC he most powerful woman at his court.
