2 CONT '''Jean I, 4th Duke de Bourbon, Duke d'Auverge, Comte de Clermont & Montpensier'''1,2
2 CONT Last Edited	30 Sep 2009
2 CONT M, #18471, '''b. March 1381, d. 5 February 1434'''
2 CONT '''Father'''	Louis II, 3rd Duke de Bourbon b. 4 Aug 1337, d. 19 Aug 1410
2 CONT '''Mother'''	Anne d' Auvergne b. 1358, d. 22 Sep 1417
2 CONT Charts	
2 CONT 14 Generation Pedigree of George III, King of Great Britain & Ireland (#1)
2 CONT 14 Generation Pedigree of George III, King of Great Britain & Ireland (#2)
2 CONT 14 Generation Pedigree of Friedrich Wilhelm III, King of Prussia
2 CONT '''     Jean I, 4th Duke de Bourbon, Duke d'Auverge, Comte de Clermont & Montpensier was born in March 1381. He married Marie du Berry''', daughter of John de Valois, Duke du Berry and Johanna d' Armagnac, '''on 24 June 1400 at Pa
2 CONC ris, Ile-de-France, France.2 Jean I, 4th Duke de Bourbon, Duke d'Auverge, Comte de Clermont & Montpensier died on 5 February 1434 at London, Middlesex, England, at age 52.'''2
2 CONT '''Family'''
2 CONT '''Marie du Berry''' b. 1367, d. Jun 1434
2 CONT '''Children'''	
