2 CONT
2 CONT Philippa of Guelders (Grave, 9 November 1467 - Convent of Poor Clares of Pont-à-Mousson, 28 February 1547[1]), was the daughter of Adolf of Egmond and Catherine of Bourbon[2].
2 CONT
2 CONT Contents
