2 CONT Charles I, Count of Ligny Born	1488 Died	1530 Noble family	House of Luxembourg Spouse(s)	Charlotte of Estouteville Father	Anthony I, Count of Ligny Mother	Françoise of Croÿ-Chimay Charles I, Count of Ligny (1488–1530) was a son of
2 CONC  Anthony I, Count of Ligny and his second wife, Françoise van Croÿe-Chimay. In 1519, he succeeded his father as Count of Brienne and Count of Ligny. Charles II, his great-grandson was imprisoned after buying a copy of William Byrd
2 CONC 's Gradualia on the basis of Catholic tensions [needs editing: William Byrd was born in 1539 or 1540].
