2 CONT *'''     Sveva Orsini was born in 1360.1 She was the daughter''' of Nicolo Orsini, Conte di Nola and Maria del Balzo, Contessa di Soleto. '''She married Francesco I del Balzo, Duca di Andria''', son of Bertrando IV del Balzo, Cont
2 CONC e di Monte-Scaglioso e di Andria and Marguerite d'Aulnay, '''on 8 December 1381.1 She died in 1404.1
