2 CONT 4.         MARGUERITE (-after Apr 1293).  The primary source which confirms her parentage and marriage has not been identified, although it is indicated by the Apr 1293 charter quoted below.   “Henry cuens de Voudoymont et...Margu
2 CONC erite sa femme” confirmed the rights of Bainville priory by charter dated Feb 1267[293].  “Marguerite de la Roche comtesse de Vaudémont” acknowledged a loan from Raoul Abbé de Saint-Epvre de Toul by charter dated Apr 1293[294].  
