2 CONT b)         HUGUES Ibelin ([1231/32]-[1254/55]).  The Lignages d'Outremer names "Jehan, Hue, Balian et Ysabeau qui espousa Henri le seignor de Giblet" as the children of "Balian…sire de Baruth" & his wife, stating that Hugues died 
2 CONC without heirs[208].  
2 CONT
2 CONT '''m''' ([1250/53]) as her first husband, his first cousin, MARIE de Montbéliard, daughter of EUDES de Montbéliard, Constable of Jerusalem & his wife Eschiva de Saint-Omer [Tiberias].  The Lignages d'Outremer names "Marie, la fill
2 CONC e Eschive, dame de Thabarie" as the wife of Hugues son of "Balian…sire de Baruth"[209].  Another section of the Lignages name "Marie, Johanne et Symone" as the three children of "Heude de Monbeliart" & his wife, stating that Marie
2 CONC  married "Hue de Ybelin et morut tantost"[210].  She married secondly Jacques Ibelin Lord of Jaffa.  
