1 NOTE {geni:about_me} -https://www.dizionariobiograficodeifriulani.it/savorgnan-girolamo
2 CONT
2 CONT Four wives and twenty-three legitimate children, plus a few illegitimate ones, testify to his stubborn determination to ensure the safety of his own lineage. 
2 CONT
2 CONT ---------------
2 CONT https://www.rikvanhauwe.be/Venice/BO/B.O.IV.S.htm
2 CONT
2 CONT Savorgnan x Malipiero anno 1501 ( Girolamo fu Pagano x Bianca fu Pietro vidua Tiepolo )
2 CONT
2 CONT Girolamo Savorgnan qu Pagano + 30.03.1529 from typhus , he was primario di Filippo , conte Osoppo . He married 4 x , a Della Torre , a Tron , a Malipiero  , a De Canal , he left 7 sons and 6 daughters
2 CONT
2 CONT He died in Ca Arimondo in San Felice
2 CONT He will be buried in Osoppo
2 CONT
2 CONT anno 1525 : Constantino ( sponsor is Filippo Tron qu Priamo in name of the father , tt. are Tommaso Dona qu Nicolo & Francesco Gabriel qu Bertucci eques )
2 CONT     1) Costantino di Girolamo qu Pagano entered Great Council on 04.12.1527 after the Barbarella
2 CONT
2 CONT no probation : Marino
2 CONT     2) Marino entered Great Council on 04.12.1532 after the Barbarella
2 CONT
2 CONT Savorgnan x De Canal anno 1509 ( Girolamo fu Pagano x Orsa fu Girolamo vidua Marcantonio Marcello )
2 CONT
2 CONT anno 1530 : Giulio ( sponsor is Constantino Savorgnan qu Girolamo in name of the father who is in the castle of Belgrado ,  tt. are Girolamo Longo qu Giovanni & Giovanni Tiepolo dquMarco )
2 CONT     1) Giulio entered Great Council on 04.1.1530 after the Barbarella
2 CONT
2 CONT anno 1531 : Mario qu Girolamo qu Pagano ( sponsor is Constantino Savorgnan qu Girolamo in name of the mother - widow , tt. are Nicolo doctor Tiepolo qu Francesco & Ermolao Priuli qu Bernardo )
2 CONT     2) Mario entered Great Council on 04.11.1532 after the Barbarella
2 CONT
2 CONT         He went to Paris , writes on 10.03.1531 to his brother Costantino who is in Venetia ( Sanudo LIV pagina 386 )
2 CONT         He went on a journey to England anno 1531 , he passed from the court of the Emperor to Gent , then Brugge which he said looks like Venice , later Nieuwpoort and then Calais
2 CONT
2 CONT anno 1534 : Germanico  ( sponsor is Giovanni Alvise Marcello qu Marcantonio in name of the mother - widow , tt. are conte Wenceslao & Santo Barbarigo avogador di vir nobilis Pietro Francesco )
2 CONT     3) Germanico qu Girolamo qu Pagano entered Great Council on 04.12.1534 after the Barbarella
2 CONT
2 CONT anno 1538 : Marco Antonio ( sponsor is the mother - widow Orsa De Canal qu Girolamo , tt. are Girolamo Longo qu Giovanni & Giovanni Battista Caotorta qu Marco )
2 CONT     4) Marco Antonio qu Girolamo qu Pagano entered Great Council on 04.12.1538 after the Barbarella
2 CONT
2 CONT Sanudo names 2 other sons , see Sanudo L . 123
2 CONT
2 CONT Ascanio
2 CONT Girolamo
