2 CONT # Abbé Vaucelle, Lettres de Nicholas V, p. 12, 126, 158, 167, 181? 183, 204, 248, 263.
2 CONT # To remember Joan, his grandmother, wife of John VI, Duke of Brittany, was the daughter of king Charles VI
2 CONT # In remembrance of Jeanne d'Évreux, grandmother of Isabelle of Brittany, wife of Guy XIV
