2 CONT
2 CONT '''Also known as Henry IV Duke of Brunswick-Luneburg'''
2 CONT
2 CONT *  HEINRICH I  (14 June 1463 – 23 June 1514), called the Elder (German: Heinrich der Ältere), a member of the House of Welf, was Duke of Brunswick-Lüneburg and ruling Prince of Wolfenbüttel from 1491 until his death.
2 CONT
2 CONT =Married=
