2 CONT
2 CONT -2. Georg I (1493–1531)
2 CONT
2 CONT -3. Anna (* 1492; † 25. April 1550), from 1521 ruling Duchess of Lubin ∞ George I of Brieg
2 CONT
2 CONT -4. Barnim IX (1501–1573)
2 CONT
2 CONT -5. Elisabeth († before 1518)
2 CONT
2 CONT -6. Barnim (* before 1501, † before 1501)
2 CONT
