2 CONT Philip III the Bold , King of France  
2 CONT
2 CONT Reign 25 August 1270 – 5 October 1285 
2 CONT
2 CONT Coronation 30 August 1271 
2 CONT
2 CONT Successor Philip IV 
2 CONT
2 CONT Consort Isabella of Aragon
2 CONT
2 CONT Father Louis IX of France 
2 CONT
2 CONT Mother Marguerite of Provence 
2 CONT
2 CONT Born 30 April 1245
