2 CONT His full title was: FRANCESCO I, 10th Duke of Naxos and of the Archipelagos 1383, Baron of Artrogidis, Lord of Milos (1376-83), Lord of Santhorini 1383, of Andros (1383-84), of Astyphalea 1383, of Delos 1383, of Ios 1383, of Paros
2 CONC  1383, Co-Lord of Amorgos, Patrizio Veneto, +1397.
