1 NOTE {geni:about_me} - https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fiorenza_I_Sanudo,_Lady_of_Milos
2 CONT
2 CONT  PLZ source for born 1383 TNX 
2 CONT
2 CONT ----------
2 CONT
2 CONT -https://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/LATIN%20LORDSHIPS%20IN%20GREECE.htm#FlorentiaIIdied1437
2 CONT
2 CONT i)      '''    FIORENZA Sanudo''' (-1437).  Her marriage is confirmed by the 16th century Annali Veneti of Stefano Magno which records that "Pietro Zen et Petronilla sua mogier" were granted "dominio dell´ isola di Andre" by "Fran
2 CONC guli Crispo suo padre et Fiorenza sua madre Duca et Duchessa dell´ Arcipelago"[800].  Lady of Milos.  She succeeded in 1383 as FIORENZA II Dss of Naxos.  
2 CONT
2 CONT '''m''' FRANCESCO Crispo Baron of Astrogidis in Eubœa, son of FRANCESCO Crispo & his wife --- (-1397).  Lord of Milos 1376.  He succeeded in 1383 as FRANCESCO I Duke of Naxos. 
2 CONT
2 CONT ---------
