2 CONC s%20palaiologos&f=false Theodore Spandounes: On the Origins of the Ottoman Emperors], Cambridge University Press, 24 Jul 1997
2 CONT * [https://www.google.com/search?sca_esv=0f8561769988ed7e&sxsrf=ACQVn0-I1ZpanKHU4R-nySlayvu65rNt4A:1713270210329&q=gidos+palaiologos&tbm=bks&source=lnms&prmd=ivbz&sa=X&ved=2ahUKEwjIvany3MaFAxUER_EDHYvXD6MQ0pQJegQIDBAB&biw=1850&bih
2 CONC =909&dpr=1 Other online google books 1]
