2 CONT
2 CONT See also
2 CONT
2 CONT Two operas are based on the story of Bayezid I and Timur Lenk, Tamerlano (1724) by Handel, and Bajazet (1735) by Vivaldi.
2 CONT
2 CONT References
2 CONT
