2 CONT https://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/FLANDERS,%20HAINAUT.htm#LouisFlandrePraetdied1396
2 CONT ----
2 CONT LOUIS bâtard de Flandre "Friese", illegitimate son of LOUIS II Count of Flanders & '''his mistress --- de Borre (-killed in battle Nicopolis 28 Sep 1396). His mother is referred to in the following source: Vredius quotes a manuscr
2 CONC ipt which records “messire Loys de Frise fils bastard de...Loys de Male conte de Flandre, lequel il eut d’une fille de Monsieur de Borre”[864].''' Heer van Praet en van der Woestijne: Espinoy records that Louis II Count of Flander
2 CONC s “en avancement de son mariage avec Dame Marie de Guistelles, Dame de Zweueghem et de Rosebeke” granted “les terres et Baronies de Praet et de la Woestine” to his illegitimate son “Messire Louys de Flandres dit le Frizon” (no sou
2 CONC rce cited)[865]. Vredius quotes a manuscript which records that Louis “eut en partage [la Wostine] par acte du 25 de septembre 1373” [date not confirmed] and died at Nikopolis 28 Sep 1396[866].
2 CONT https://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/FLANDERS,%20HAINAUT.htm#LouisFlandrePraetdied1396
2 CONT ----
