2 CONC  Gelre Graaf van Zutphen''', son of Johan II Heer van Egmont and Maria van Arkel-Pierrepont, '''on 23 July 1423 at Kleve, Germany.1 She died on 20 February 1479 at age 61 at Lobith, The Netherlands.1 She was buried at Grave, The N
