2 CONT ----------
2 CONT /!\ Cobella RUFFO 1 was born 1412 in Corigliano, Cosenza, Italy. She died 1442 in Maine, France. Cobella married Charles d' ANJOU Comte du Maine on 1434 in Maine, France.
