1 NOTE {geni:about_me} (Janet Grant, who was married to Alexander Gordon of Strathavon, has been claimed as a daughter of James Grant of Freuchie, but she was more probably a daughter or sister of '''John Grant of Ballindalloch'''.)
2 CONT
2 CONT Alexander Gordon, of Strathavon (Strathdoun), 1st of Cluny married the  youngest daughter of '''John Grant of Grant''', by whom he had four daughters and two sons:
2 CONT
2 CONT *             1. Alexander                 d. young, leaving one daughter
2 CONT *             2. John Who succeeded to Cluny, and was the ancestor of the families of  Cluny, Birsmoir, Pittendreich, and others
2 CONT
2 CONT Sources
2 CONT # [http://www.thegordondnaproject.com/35045.html The Gordon DNA Project]
2 CONT # [http://www.baronage.co.uk/bphtm-03/grant-03.html Grant of Freuchie and of Grant]
