2 NICK The Red
1 NAME Archibald "The Red" //
2 GIVN Archibald "The Red"
2 SURN Campbell
1 SEX M
1 BURI
2 PLAC Kilmun Collegiate Church
2 ADDR
3 CITY Kilmun
3 STAE Scotland
1 BIRT
2 DATE ABT AUG 1508
2 ADDR
3 CTRY Scotland
