2 CONT
2 CONT == First Marriage == 
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Elizabeth Butter, here treated, married Sir Patrick Stewart of Stukis. She is identified as his future wife in a charter dated 15 January 1553-54.  [https://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/details.aspx?reference=
