1 OCCU Baroness
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Only daughter of George Douglas, 1st Earl of Angus (1370-1402) by Princess Mary (d. before 1458), daughter of Robert III, King of Scots.
2 CONT
2 CONT Widow of 1st Lord Forbes
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ---------
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT From Darryl Lundy's Peerage page on Lady Elizabeth Douglas:
2 CONT
2 CONT http://thepeerage.com/p10823.htm#i108221
2 CONT
2 CONT Lady Elizabeth Douglas [1]
2 CONT *F, #108221
2 CONT *Last Edited=8 May 2011
2 CONT *Consanguinity Index=0.07%
2 CONT
2 CONT Lady Elizabeth Douglas married, firstly, Alexander Forbes, 1st Lord Forbes, son of Sir John Forbes of that Ilk and Elizabeth Kennedy, between 6 October 1423 and 16 October 1423.[2] 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married, secondly, Sir David Hay of Lochorwart and Yester, son of Sir William Hay of Lochorwart and Yester and Alice de la Haye, after 1423.[3]
2 CONT
2 CONT She is the daughter of George Douglas, 1st Earl of Angus and Lady Mary Stewart.[1] 
2 CONT
2 CONT From between 6 October 1423 and 16 October 1423, her married name became Forbes.[2] 
2 CONT
2 CONT From after 1423, her married name became Hay.[3]
2 CONT
2 CONT Child of Lady Elizabeth Douglas and Sir David Hay of Lochorwart and Yester
2 CONT *1. John Hay, 1st Lord Hay of Yester+4 d. bt Sep 1508 - 23 Oct 1508
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Lady Elizabeth Douglas and Alexander Forbes, 1st Lord Forbes
2 CONT *1. Annabella Forbes+5
2 CONT *2. James Forbes, 2nd Lord Forbes+ d. bt 20 Sep 1460 - 30 Jul 1462
2 CONT *3. William Forbes5
2 CONT *4. Margaret Forbes5
2 CONT *5. Elizabeth Forbes5
2 CONT *6. Susanna Forbes+6 b. c 1423
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT (Lady) Elizabeth Douglas is the daughter of 
2 CONT * Earl George Douglas of Angus 1376-1402
2 CONT * Princess Mary Stuart of Scotland 1378-1457
2 CONT
2 CONT she was also married to:
2 CONT
2 CONT (Sir) David Hay (of Yester) 1400–1478 Birth ABT. 1400 • Lochorwart Castle, Midlothian, , Scotland  Death 2 SEP 1478 • Gifford, East Lothian, , Scotland 
2 CONT ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT From Paul, James Balfour. ''The Scots Peerage''.  Vol 8, page 429 < [https://archive.org/details/scotspeeragefoun08pauluoft/page/428/mode/2up Archive.Org] > 
2 CONT
2 CONT [SIR DAVID HAY of Locherworth and Yester, Sheriff Peebles, next brother and heir of the last, being third son of Sir William Hay of Locherworth, by his wife Alicia Hay of Erroll …] 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married ''Mary'', [sic: Elizabeth] relict (married before 1423) of Alexander (Forbes), first Lord Forbes (who died 1448), only daughter of George (Douglas), first Earl of Angus, by the Princess Mary, daughter of King Robert.
2 CONT
2 CONT She had previously, in 1409, when she must have been a child, been betrothed to a son of Sir William Hay of Locherworth,2 possibly David's elder brother William, who died young v.p. 
2 CONT
2 CONT They had issue : —
2 CONT * 1. JOHN, his heir, afterwards first Lord Hay of Yester.
2 CONT * 2. Andrew. Rector of Biggar in 1469,3 when he must have been under age. He was apparently4 the Maister Andrew Hay, Provost of Bothans, who brought a suit in Parliament, in December 1475, against Robert, Lord Fleming, which he wo
2 CONC n, Lord Fleming being adjudged to pay him 10s. and 8d. for the debt.5
2 CONT * 3. Margaret, married to Sir Niel Ouningham of Barns, co. Fife.8
2 CONT
2 CONT Thomas Sheriff Depute of Peebles 14 June 1471 ,7 may have been a son. He was dead before 6 May 1491 when Christian Hay, widow and executrix of Thomas Hay, the late Sheriff Depute of Peebles, pursued in Parliament Thomas Hunter and
2 CONC  others for debts severally owing by them to her husband,8 for which he was adjudged to pay her 10I.9 She was still living 12 February 1491-92.10
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT Here is the lineage to King Robert I
2 CONT
2 CONT (King) Robert I (aka Robert VIII de Bruce) (of Scotland) (1274 - 1329) 20th great-grandfather
2 CONT
2 CONT (King) Robert II (of Scotland) (1316 - 1390) Son of (King) Robert I (aka Robert VIII de Bruce) (of Scotland)
2 CONT
2 CONT (King) Robert III of Scotland (aka John Robert Stuart) (1337 - 1406) Son of (King) Robert II (of Scotland)
2 CONT
2 CONT (Princess) Mary Stuart (of Scotland) (1378 - 1457) Daughter of (King) Robert III of Scotland (aka John Robert Stuart)
2 CONT
2 CONT (Lady) Elizabeth Douglas (1398 - 1460) Daughter of (Princess) Mary Stuart (of Scotland)
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
