1 NAME James "The Younger" /Kennedy/ of Dunure
2 GIVN James "The Younger"
2 SURN Kennedy
2 NSFX of Dunure
2 _MARNM Kennedy
2 NICK Sir James Kennedy of Dunure
2 NICK the Younger
2 NICK Sir James Kennedy of Dunure the Younger
1 NAME II James /Kennedy/
1 NAME Sir James Kennedy of Dunure the Younger
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 1376
2 ADDR
3 CITY Dunmure, Mayboie
3 CTRY Scotland
1 DEAT
2 DATE 8 NOV 1408
2 ADDR
