2 CONC e had James, thereafter Earl of Morton, and Henry Douglas, first of Corhead (c) and Lang Niddry.   1 Which James was, by the special Favour of King James II rais'd to the Dignity of Earl of Morton, in Parliament on the 14th of Mar
