2 CONT *Mother     Eleanor Sinclair, Countess of Atholl,   b. Abt 1454, of, Ravenscraig, Fifeshire, Scotland ,   d. 21 Mar 1518-1519 
2 CONT *'''Family      Sir Robert Gordon, of Pitlurg,   b. Abt 1479, of, Pitlurg, Aberdeenshire, Scotland ,   d. 1544 
2 CONT *Children 
