2 CONT
2 CONT married 
2 CONT # John (or Robert) GORDON 3rd of Auchleuchries, son of John GORDON 2nd of Auchleuchries, 1st of Pitlurg and Margaret FORBES. (John GORDON 3rd of Auchleuchries was born about 1481 and died about 1546 3.)
2 CONT
2 CONT >Notes 
2 CONT >* "7.         JEAN .  m as his first wife, Sir ROBERT Gordon of Pitlurgo." (FMG)
2 CONT >* Burke's Dormant and Extinct Peerages, p 509, says Jean married "Sir Robert Gordon of Pitlurg"
