1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Elizabeth Stewart was born illegitimately.1 She is the daughter of James Stewart, 1st Earl of Buchan.1 
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Family 
2 CONT
2 CONT http://thepeerage.com/p31981.htm#i319809
2 CONT
2 CONT She married, firstly, Mungo Home, son of John Home and Margaret Ker, in 1507.1 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married, secondly, Patrick Sinclair, son of Edward Sinclair, 2nd of Dryden and unknown Crichton, after 1513.1
2 CONT
2 CONT From 1507, her married name became Home.1 From after 1513, her married name became Sinclair.1
2 CONT Children of Elizabeth Stewart and Mungo Home
2 CONT
2 CONT *Sir John Home+1 d. c Nov 1573
2 CONT *Alexander Home1
2 CONT
