1 NAME Thomas /of Lancaster/ 1st Duke of Clarence
2 GIVN Thomas
2 SURN of Lancaster
2 NSFX 1st Duke of Clarence
2 _MARNM of Lancaster
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 29 SEP 1388
