2 CONT www.findagrave.com
2 CONT
2 CONT Anne Beaufort Paston BIRTH	24 Mar 1443 London, City of London, Greater London, England DEATH	17 Sep 1496 (aged 53) London, City of London, Greater London, England BURIAL	 Blackfriars London Ludgate, City of London, Greater London,
2 CONC  England  MEMORIAL ID	106039094 
2 CONT
2 CONT Third daughter of Sir Edmund de Beaufort and Eleanor Beauchamp., descendant of King Edward I. She was the wife of Sir William Paston, married about 1469 and had one son and four daughters: William Mary, wife of Ralph Neville, Lord
2 CONC  Neville Margaret Anne, wife of Sir Gilbert Talbot Elizabeth, wife of Sir John Savill
2 CONT
2 CONT Sir William was buried 17 Sept 1496, and left a will requesting burial next to his late wife.
2 CONT
