1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Thomas de Courtenay and Margaret Beaufort did have a daughter named Agnes.  Alison Weir, in her work on British Royal Families, gives her as married to Richard Saunder.  The dates for that Agnes, however, are probl
2 CONC ematic; in order for her to have married and had children when she did, she would have been born after Margaret Beaufort’s death, or at least after Margaret Beaufort was having children.  
2 CONT
2 CONT That profile can be found here:
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.geni.com/people/Agnes-N-N/600000000086231324
