2 CONT <blockquote>'''Lady Beatrice Douglas, here treated, is not the same person as https://www.geni.com/people/Beatrix-Douglas/6000000002116161089 who was the daughter of https://www.geni.com/people/James-Douglas-3rd-Earl-of-Morton-1st
2 CONC -Earl-of-Arran/6000000003876555042?through=6000000002116161089 Nor is she the same person as https://www.geni.com/people/Beatrix-Douglas/6000000017518155205 who was the daughter of https://www.geni.com/people/James-Douglas-of-Mort
2 CONC on/6000000064070349821?through=6000000064070405821 [Particular Register of Sasines for the Sheriffdom of Lanark, reference RS40/I/214]'''</blockquote>
2 CONT
