2 CONT == The Question of Identity ==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Lady Beatrice Douglas, here treated, also called Elizabeth, is the daughter of https://www.geni.com/people/John-Douglas-2nd-Earl-of-Morton/5201952706010126513?through=6000000002032127301 and https://www.geni.com/people/Janet-Cr
2 CONC ichton-Countess-of-Morton/6000000002005852344?through=6000000002032127301 [https://archive.org/details/scotspeeragefoun06pauluoft/page/358/mode/1up The Scots Peerage VI: 358]'''
