2 CONT == [http://thepeerage.com/p2982.htm#i29811 Biographical Summary by Darryl Lundy's Peerage] ==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Lady Elizabeth Douglas was the daughter of John Douglas, 2nd Earl of Morton and Janet Crichton. She married Robert Keith, Master of Marischal, son of William Keith, 2nd Earl Marischal and Lady Elizabeth Gordon, before 8 January
2 CONC  1505/6. She died on 2 May 1527. Lady Elizabeth Douglas was also known as Beatrice. From before 8 January 1505/6, her married name became Keith. Children of Lady Elizabeth Douglas and Robert Keith, Master of Marischal (1) William 
2 CONC Keith, 3rd Earl Marischal+1 d. 7 Oct 1581 (2) Elizabeth Keith+ (3) Janet Keith+ (4) Christian Keith+1 d. a 12 Jul 1553 (5)Robert Keith+1 d. 12 Jun 1551 (6) Alexander Keith.'''
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/250164890/lady_elizabeth_beatrice-keith
2 CONT
2 CONT Birth
2 CONT 1488
2 CONT Dumfries and Galloway, Scotland
2 CONT Death
2 CONT 5 May 1527 (aged 38–39)
2 CONT Dunnottar, Aberdeenshire, Scotland
2 CONT Elizabeth was the daughter of John Douglas and Jane Crichton.
2 CONT She married Sir Robert Keith on Mar 27, 1504. They had 7 children: Alice, William, Beatrice, Robert, Alexander, Elizabeth, and Christian.
2 CONT They were married for 9 years, when John was killed in the battle of Flodden Field.
