2 CONC h mill, in earldom of Atholl, sheriffdom of Perth, 7 December 1536. Signed by granter. Seal damaged on tag. Witnesses: Archibald Campbell of Glenlyon, masters and sirs James Cramby, vicar of Telling, John Aisoune in Tulymat and si
2 CONC r Christopher Reocht and sir Robert MakNair, vicars of Killin and Litle Dunkeld. [https://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/details.aspx?reference=GD112%2f2%2f147%2f2&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=&ko=p&r=GD112%2f2%2f147
