2 CONT *''''''     Catherine Sinclair married Alexander Stewart, Earl of March, Mar, Garioch; Duke of Albany, son of James II Stewart, King of Scotland and Marie of Guelders. Catherine Sinclair and Alexander Stewart, Earl of March, Mar, 
2 CONC Garioch; Duke of Albany were divorced on 2 March 1478.2
