2 CONT MEMORIAL ID     86650889
2 CONT French nobility. Born in Paris as the youngest daughter of Antoine de Bourbon and Jeanne d'Albret. From 1577 until 1592 she acted as regent of Navarra for her brother. Her marriage to Henri II of Lorraine remained childless.
