0 @N6000000002188008395@ NOTE Edmund Holland, 4th Earl of Kent
1 CONT From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia
1 CONT
1 CONT Edmund de Holland, 4th Earl of Kent (January 6, ?1383 — September 15, ?1407) was the Earl of Kent in ca. 1400 - ca. 1407. He had an affair with Constance of York and fathered illegitimately Eleanor de Holland born in c. 1406.
1 CONT
1 CONT [edit]
