1 CONT As King: (16 September 1380–26 September 1386);
1 CONT (28 December 1386–6 February 1392)
1 CONT Born 3 December 1368(1368-12-03)
1 CONT Paris, France
1 CONT Died 21 October 1422 (aged 53)
1 CONT Paris, France
