1 CONC  Alexander Ogilvy of Auchterhouse, through whom he became Hereditary Sheriff of Forfar.  [Burke's Peerage]
0 @N6000000003615777663@ NOTE James II; born 16 Oct 1430; married 3 July 1449 Mary (died 1 Dec 1463), daughter of Arnold, Duke of Gueldres, and was killed by the bursting of one of his own cannon while besieging the English in Roxburgh Castle 3 Aug 1460.  [Bur
1 CONC ke's Peerage]
1 CONT
