0 @N6000000002187840151@ NOTE Agnès of Valois
1 CONT From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia
1 CONT Jump to: navigation, search
1 CONT Agnès of Valois is the third oldest daughter of John II of France, and Bonne of Luxembourg. She was born in 1345 and died in 1349. Her sisters were Marie (married Robert I, Duke of Bar, Jeanne (who married Charles II the Bad, King
1 CONC  of Navarre, Marguerite, and Isabelle (married Gian Galeazzo I, Duke of Milan).
