1 CONT Thomas Hay was the son of William Hay, 3rd Earl of Erroll and Lady Isabella Gordon.
1 CONT
1 CONT Marriage and Child
1 CONT
1 CONT He married Margaret Logie, daughter of Lyon Logie of that Ilk. They had one child:
1 CONT George Hay, 7th Earl of Erroll  d. 30 Jan 1573/74
1 CONT
1 CONT Death
1 CONT
1 CONT He fought in the Battle of Flodden on 9 September 1513 and was killed in action
1 CONT
