1 CONT some reason described himself as "the worst of Kings, and the most wretched
1 CONT of men".
0 @N6000000001713328517@ NOTE Robert III (Robert John STEWART) King Of SCOTLAND [Parents] was born about 1337 in Dundonald, Ayrshire, Scotland. He died on 4 Apr 1406 in Rothsay Castle, Dundonald, Ayrshire, Scotland and was buried in 1406 in Paisley, Renfrewshi
1 CONC re, Scotland. Robert married Annabella DRUMMOND on 13 Mar 1365 in Dispensation, , , Scotland.
1 CONT
1 CONT Annabella DRUMMOND [Parents] was born about 1350 in Of, Stobhall, Cargill, Perthshire, Scotland. She died in 1401 in , Scone, Perthshire, Scotland and was buried in 1401 in , Dunfermline, Fifeshire, Scotland. Annabella married Rob
1 CONC ert III (Robert John STEWART) King Of SCOTLAND on 13 Mar 1365 in Dispensation, , , Scotland.
1 CONT
1 CONT They had the following children:
1 CONT
1 CONT F i Margaret, Princess Of SCOTLAND was born about 1370 in Of, Dunfermline, Fifeshire, Scotland. She died before Sep 1456 in Thrieve Castle, Galloway, Galloway, Scotland and was buried in Lincluden Chaple, Kirknewton, Mid-Lothian, 
1 CONC Scotland.
1 CONT M ii David Prince Of SCOTLAND was born on 24 Oct 1378 in Of, Dunfermline, Fifeshire, Scotland. He died on 26 Mar 1402 in Falkland Castle, Falkland, Fifeshire, Scotland and was buried in Lindores Abbey, , , Scotlan
1 CONT F iii Mary STEWART was born about 1380 and died in 1458.
1 CONT M iv James I King Of SCOTLAND was born in Dec 1394 and died on 21 Feb 1436/1437.
1 CONT M v Robert, Prince Of SCOTLAND was born about 1383 in Of, Dunfermline, Fifeshire, Scotland.
1 CONT F vi Elizabeth Princess Of SCOTLAND was born about 1387 in Of, Dunfermline, Fifeshire, Scotland. She died before 1478.
1 CONT F vii Egidia, Princess Of SCOTLAND was born about 1390 in Of, Dunfermline, Fifeshire, Scotland.
1 CONT M viii John STEWART was born about 1368 in Blackhall and was christened in Of, Ardgowan, , Scotland.
1 CONT
1 CONT
1 CONT Stuart, Robert III (John) of Scotland, King of Scotland
1 CONT Born: 1337
1 CONT Acceded: 14 AUG 1390, Scone Abbey, Perthshire
1 CONT Died: 4 APR 1406, Rothsay Castle
