0 @N6000000002322286480@ NOTE While their father was imprisoned by the King of Spain at Madrid, part of the
1 CONT treaty to release him was to give up territories, marry Eleanor, and deliver
1 CONT his two eldest sons, 7 and 8 years old, as hostages. The surrendered provinces
1 CONT refused to divorce themselves from France. Furious with the purjured Francis,
1 CONT King of France, Charles I of Spain held the children prisoners for 4 years
