0 @N6000000003658776059@ NOTE From Plantagenet Ancestry:
1 CONT
1 CONT JEAN DE LUXEMBOURG, Knt., seigneur of Beaurevoir and Richebourg, and, in the right of his wife, Count of Conversano (in Apulia) and Brienne (in Champagne), seigneur of Enhien (in Hainault) and Gouy-sur-Piéton, 3rd son.  He married
1 CONC  about 1380 MARGUERITE D'ENGHIEN .... They had three sons ... and two daughters .... He was in the service of Marie of Brittany, Queen of Sicily and Duchess of Naples.
