0 @N6000000004533114840@ NOTE From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia.
1 CONT Henry VII (January 28, 1457 – April 21, 1509), King of England, Lordof Ireland (August 22, 1485 – April 21, 1509), was the founder of theTudor dynasty and is generally acknowledged as one of England's mostsuccessful kings.
1 CONT
