0 @N6000000002188378215@ NOTE Christian II of Denmark
1 CONT From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia
1 CONT
1 CONT Christian II
1 CONT King of Denmark, Sweden and Norway, the Wends and the Goths, Duke of Schleswig, Holstein, Stormarn and Dithmarschen, Count of Oldenburg and Delmenhorst[1] (more...)
1 CONT King of Norway (more...)
