1 CONT Predecessor Hans
1 CONT Successor Frederick I
1 CONT Coronation 20 July 1514
1 CONT King of Denmark (more...)
1 CONT Reign 22 July 1513 – 20 January 1523
1 CONT Predecessor Hans
1 CONT Successor Frederick I
1 CONT Coronation 11 June 1514
1 CONT King of Sweden (more...)
1 CONT Reign 1 November 1520 – August 1521
1 CONT Predecessor Sten Sture the Younger (as regent)
1 CONT Successor Gustav I
1 CONT Coronation 4 November 1520
1 CONT Consort Isabella of Burgundy
1 CONT Issue
1 CONT Christina, Duchess of Milan
1 CONT Royal house House of Oldenburg
1 CONT Royal motto Thus it was ordained
1 CONT Father Hans
1 CONT Mother Christina of Saxony
1 CONT Born 1 July 1481(1481-07-01)
1 CONT Nyborg Castle
1 CONT Died 25 January 1559 (aged 77)
