1 CONC ers ....  In 1292 his older brother, Hugh, Count of Blois, surrendered St.-Pol to him.  In 1297 Philippe le Bel, King of France, granted him certain land appurtenant to the monestary of Saint-Lucien de Beauvais.  She joined the En
